      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The experience with simultaneous operations in 16 patients with multifocal atherosclerosis and cholelithiasis is analyzed. The operations were performed simultaneously through two mini-approaches with original \"mini-assistant\" devices. Short- and long-term postoperative results are analyzed, indications and surgical techniques through mini-approach in elderly patients are reported."},
